{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645240/extras/CT_-_SupporterPreviewTall_01__2_.jpg?t=1747921989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Celebrate the world of <i>City Tales</i> with this special Supporter Pack! Expand your experience and support us with:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Out Game elements:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The official <i>City Tales</i> soundtrack (10 tracks for the Early Access launch)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A beautifully illustrated Lore Book featuring key art and rich narrative details</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>In Game elements:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 exclusive decorations to customize your city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One unique narrative-driven quest that unlock the special decorations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A distinctive supporter-exclusive logo for the main menu</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And of course, <strong>a huge thanks from the dev team Irregular Shapes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note:</strong> The Lore Book and soundtrack will be downloaded directly into the root folder of your <i>City Tales</i> game. Access your local game files to retrieve them once you've purchased the Supporter Pack.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645240?t=1747921989","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645240?t=1747921989","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645240/85d657998f1007b3d711787d39d81b8b4b72fe3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747921989","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645240/85d657998f1007b3d711787d39d81b8b4b72fe3a/capsul